{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46809","headline":"谢王詹事垂访 · 齐己","name":"谢王詹事垂访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟外孤峯未得归，人间触类是无机。\n方悲鹿轸栖江寺，忽讶轺车降竹扉。\n王泽乍闻谭涣汗，国风那得话玄微。\n应惊老病炎天里，枯骨肩横一衲衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}